        "label_text": "CARBON DIOXIDE 5-B:C. For flammable liquid and energized electrical fires. Not effective on wood/paper. Do not touch the horn (frostbite)."}},
    "water_extinguisher": {"is_a": "fire_extinguisher", "doc": "2.5 gal pressurized water, UL 2-A. Never on grease or energized equipment.",
